[{:db/id 17592186157394 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-da4e5265-9949-5f02-b346-af79bf8d00ab" "question-10b4599a-65d6-546d-a1db-2b8fd1bfb09d" "question-2ced0c63-cf37-5cdb-ae0d-645ad331eb6b" "question-9e993c85-9e06-5795-8658-efd529bfafbc" "question-84598522-637e-5d77-b555-f1f4d414ed22"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186156995 :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n![](images/f3/f3149524cf7975083139c82369095a564c5cb28e66ecd1bdab94721c64bd6d21.svg)\n\nCalculate $\\textrm{E}[X^2].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the expected value of $X^2$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\textrm{E}[X^2] = \\int_{S} x^2 \\cdot f(x) \\,\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we compute the expected value of $X^2$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{-2}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-2}^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}\\,x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{\\int }_{-2}^{0}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{3}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}\\,{x}^{3}\\,{|}_{-2}^{0}+\\frac{3}{8}\\,{x}^{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{24}(0+8)+\\frac{3}{8}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{3}{8} \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{24}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186157395 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6e408aa1-cabb-5d40-b79a-58877a0c50b9" "question-4c7b6764-ca2b-56e1-8efb-c299f7c5895e" "question-6e9a565a-12f8-5f6b-b609-40f05cb5f2ab" "question-2dabf35b-e60b-5d7b-a653-f44f57203be2"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186156996 :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n![](images/19/1940f446dbc6c352b86f413501008abd7ac519a79cfa6be9b7207ecfe13609a7.svg)\n\nCalculate $\\textrm E [X^4].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the $n$th raw moment of $X$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\textrm{E}[X^n] = \\int_{S} x^n \\cdot f(x) \\,\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we compute the fourth raw moment of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{4}] & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{x}^{4}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{4}\\cdot (1-x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{4}-{x}^{5})\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{5}\\,{x}^{5}-\\frac{1}{6}\\,{x}^{6})\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{1}{10}\\,{x}^{5}\\,{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{5}-\\frac{1}{6}-0)+\\frac{1}{10}(32-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{30}+\\frac{31}{10} \\\\  & =\\frac{47}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186157393 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-90065876-8b39-51cd-875c-5aa5721dc0eb" "question-993709fe-5242-5062-93c5-df6c430c3cdf" "question-8ee689ae-d309-5b9e-a1ff-6e4de3b135ae" "question-78882664-5ca1-5d0e-9798-9cca3f283762" "question-63bcffd8-dbf0-5c48-8ca6-56531c05d1c3"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186156994 :question/problem "The continuous random variable $X$ has the following probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x) = 2x, \\quad 0 \\leq x \\leq 1\n$$\n\nGiven that $\\textrm{E}[X] = \\dfrac{2}{3},$ compute $\\textrm{E}[5X^2 - 2X].$\n\n*Hint: You may assume that $\\textrm{E}[aX + bY] = a\\textrm{E}[X] + b\\textrm{E}[Y]$ for any random variables $X$ and $Y$ and constants $a$ and $b.$*" :question/worked-solution "First, we simplify using the hint and the properties of expected value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[5{X}^{2}-2X] & =5\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-2\\text{E}[X]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the $n$th raw moment of $X$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\textrm{E}[X^n] = \\int_S x^n \\cdot f(x) \\,\\textrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe already know $\\textrm E [X].$ So, we compute the second raw moment of $X$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\,{x}^{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $\\textrm{E}[X] = \\dfrac{2}{3}$ and $\\textrm{E}[X^2] = \\dfrac{1}{2}$ into the simplified expression, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[5{X}^{2}-2X] & =5\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-2\\text{E}[X] \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{4}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-da4e5265-9949-5f02-b346-af79bf8d00ab" :question/id #uuid "da4e5265-9949-5f02-b346-af79bf8d00ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-152893" :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{x},\\,1\\le x\\le e.\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\int }_{S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe compute the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{e}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{1}^{e} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2}-1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fe3f6c56-86fd-5d50-bf8e-6a665c9d1d81"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fe3f6c56-86fd-5d50-bf8e-6a665c9d1d81" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe3f6c56-86fd-5d50-bf8e-6a665c9d1d81" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d48438e0-ad44-5549-be39-5c0e85922b04" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e9581c29-d1f3-501f-b511-24d9262ee1fa" "answer-9c78447b-33fa-5682-bca2-d662339a7e1d" "answer-758281e4-a9bd-53f0-8d16-4de28b45b246" "answer-d48438e0-ad44-5549-be39-5c0e85922b04" "answer-4a13ee3f-d613-5356-b098-bfd4fd31aaad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e9581c29-d1f3-501f-b511-24d9262ee1fa" :answer/id #uuid "e9581c29-d1f3-501f-b511-24d9262ee1fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2(e+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c78447b-33fa-5682-bca2-d662339a7e1d" :answer/id #uuid "9c78447b-33fa-5682-bca2-d662339a7e1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{e}^{2}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-758281e4-a9bd-53f0-8d16-4de28b45b246" :answer/id #uuid "758281e4-a9bd-53f0-8d16-4de28b45b246" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{e-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d48438e0-ad44-5549-be39-5c0e85922b04" :answer/id #uuid "d48438e0-ad44-5549-be39-5c0e85922b04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{2}-1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4a13ee3f-d613-5356-b098-bfd4fd31aaad" :answer/id #uuid "4a13ee3f-d613-5356-b098-bfd4fd31aaad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "e+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-10b4599a-65d6-546d-a1db-2b8fd1bfb09d" :question/id #uuid "10b4599a-65d6-546d-a1db-2b8fd1bfb09d" :question/math-academy-id "q-152901" :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3}, & -1<x<0, \\\\ {x}^{2}, & 0\\le x<1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\int }_{S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we compute the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}\\,{x}^{3}\\,{|}_{-1}^{0}+\\frac{1}{5}\\,{x}^{5}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}(0+1)+\\frac{1}{5}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}+\\frac{1}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{19}{45}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ea5d3c17-6171-5c4e-88bb-85a10dbabe26"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ea5d3c17-6171-5c4e-88bb-85a10dbabe26" :answer-field/id #uuid "ea5d3c17-6171-5c4e-88bb-85a10dbabe26" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-17fc818e-1be8-57fa-8910-2ceb34d1bfea" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9d0bfc22-7fbd-53d9-bfaf-6dd316f1bf07" "answer-17fc818e-1be8-57fa-8910-2ceb34d1bfea" "answer-70d02cfc-345f-501e-aae7-81b360481a06" "answer-2eb44b98-48db-57a3-ba4e-4af609be3544" "answer-0addfc1b-9d02-54e5-8a6c-dd9cd58986f2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9d0bfc22-7fbd-53d9-bfaf-6dd316f1bf07" :answer/id #uuid "9d0bfc22-7fbd-53d9-bfaf-6dd316f1bf07" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17fc818e-1be8-57fa-8910-2ceb34d1bfea" :answer/id #uuid "17fc818e-1be8-57fa-8910-2ceb34d1bfea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{19}{45}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70d02cfc-345f-501e-aae7-81b360481a06" :answer/id #uuid "70d02cfc-345f-501e-aae7-81b360481a06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2eb44b98-48db-57a3-ba4e-4af609be3544" :answer/id #uuid "2eb44b98-48db-57a3-ba4e-4af609be3544" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0addfc1b-9d02-54e5-8a6c-dd9cd58986f2" :answer/id #uuid "0addfc1b-9d02-54e5-8a6c-dd9cd58986f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2ced0c63-cf37-5cdb-ae0d-645ad331eb6b" :question/id #uuid "2ced0c63-cf37-5cdb-ae0d-645ad331eb6b" :question/math-academy-id "q-152894" :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{7}}},\\,x\\ge 1.\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\int }_{S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe compute the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{7}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{x}^{-3/2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{1}^{a}{x}^{-3/2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{(-2{x}^{-1/2})|}_{1}^{a} \\\\  & =-5{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}})|}_{1}^{a} \\\\  & =-5{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}-1) \\\\  & =-5(0-1) \\\\  & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7772a622-a1f8-5d76-a766-05c455036ddd"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7772a622-a1f8-5d76-a766-05c455036ddd" :answer-field/id #uuid "7772a622-a1f8-5d76-a766-05c455036ddd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d0830450-b640-5ef8-acf1-352175173674" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c62aec32-e023-537a-a5de-f2c36d94cec6" "answer-86079644-a0ec-53b0-b8f8-e8a0cb61db27" "answer-d0830450-b640-5ef8-acf1-352175173674" 