ot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{9}\\,{x}^{6}\\,{|}_{0}^{1}+\\frac{1}{9}\\,{x}^{3}\\,{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{9}(1-0)+\\frac{1}{9}(8-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{9}+\\frac{7}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{11}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a45670cd-9618-5c8d-b9e3-77951bdb7b1b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a45670cd-9618-5c8d-b9e3-77951bdb7b1b" :answer-field/id #uuid "a45670cd-9618-5c8d-b9e3-77951bdb7b1b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-88154b96-2e73-5a0a-bc21-32bcd5e8f45d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-88154b96-2e73-5a0a-bc21-32bcd5e8f45d" "answer-74b705a1-7b7f-567b-b1a0-4e5f5a39eca9" "answer-0b9101a2-c4eb-5ffc-8017-56ef5d0f4631" "answer-e30c5074-c231-5111-a50b-ae42316e1152" "answer-c59c5886-4339-5c0d-ad4e-c08302875680"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-88154b96-2e73-5a0a-bc21-32bcd5e8f45d" :answer/id #uuid "88154b96-2e73-5a0a-bc21-32bcd5e8f45d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{11}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74b705a1-7b7f-567b-b1a0-4e5f5a39eca9" :answer/id #uuid "74b705a1-7b7f-567b-b1a0-4e5f5a39eca9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{13}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0b9101a2-c4eb-5ffc-8017-56ef5d0f4631" :answer/id #uuid "0b9101a2-c4eb-5ffc-8017-56ef5d0f4631" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e30c5074-c231-5111-a50b-ae42316e1152" :answer/id #uuid "e30c5074-c231-5111-a50b-ae42316e1152" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c59c5886-4339-5c0d-ad4e-c08302875680" :answer/id #uuid "c59c5886-4339-5c0d-ad4e-c08302875680" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-84598522-637e-5d77-b555-f1f4d414ed22" :question/id #uuid "84598522-637e-5d77-b555-f1f4d414ed22" :question/math-academy-id "q-152899" :question/problem "A continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function \n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}, & -1<x<0, \\\\ \\frac{4}{3}\\,x, & 0\\le x<1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$" :question/worked-solution "For a continuous random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ defined over a set $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]={\\int }_{S}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, we compute the expected value of ${X}^{2}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{x}^{2}\\cdot {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}\\,x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{0}{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x+\\frac{4}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\,{x}^{5}\\,{|}_{-1}^{0}+\\frac{1}{3}\\,{x}^{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}(0+1)+\\frac{1}{3}(1-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{15}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-03eb10c9-9e29-5bb8-8db9-ad1064b9deaf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-03eb10c9-9e29-5bb8-8db9-ad1064b9deaf" :answer-field/id #uuid "03eb10c9-9e29-5bb8-8db9-ad1064b9deaf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ec5e19b7-9577-599a-b29a-d5fbd4562df7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-17b6397b-6d8a-502f-b1bb-d6805bac1e89" "answer-8386f4fd-561f-5977-a7b8-f5fa721f4d98" "answer-1787c976-b394-5db2-9647-7788ad9018da" "answer-69257811-1577-5b8b-814f-a4ffc4c0084f" "answer-ec5e19b7-9577-599a-b29a-d5fbd4562df7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 